            "category": "Products & Technology",
            "question": "What is Europa Light?",
            "answer": "<p> Lumina Europa is a European skincare brand focused on advanced nanofibre technology, careful formulation and the idea that skincare can be both effective and a true ritual. Our products are designed to bring carefully selected ingredients into close and uniform contact with the skin. </p>",
            "open_by_default": true
